    "en": {
      "trackName": "Deep Parkour: Watch Games",
      "description": "Deep Parkour: Submarine Game\nDive into the abyss directly from your wrist. Control a high-tech submarine through dangerous deep-sea caverns using the Digital Crown for precision steering. It is not just about survival, it is about mastery. Dodge the obstacles and beat the high score.\nFeatures:\n\t•\tPrecision Control: Rotate the Digital Crown to steer smoothly.\n\t•\tPowerful Tools: Blast obstacles with Lasers or use Time Freeze to escape tight spots.\n\t•\tDeep Sea Challenge: Endless gameplay with increasing difficulty.\n\t•\tFully Offline: Play anywhere, anytime. No internet or WiFi required.\nReady to dive? Start your journey now.",
